Avatar PRNG/HSL algorithms in src/web/NativeListAvatarWorker.js are adapted from
MyCrypto ethereum-blockies-base64 1.0.2 (MIT), commit
1290187d9c099335a06a2f867d5240a6034a6631. The upstream package declares MyCrypto
as its author and MIT as its license, but contains no separate LICENSE file.
The inline MIT grant remains in the worker. The upstream pnglib implementation
is not included; PNG encoding uses OffscreenCanvas.
